sequenceDiagram
actor User
participant Web as Rkestr Web
participant API as Rkestr API
participant Auth as Identity
participant DB as PostgreSQL
User->>Web: Submit credentials
Web->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
API->>Auth: Authenticate
Auth->>DB: Load user / credential state
DB-->>Auth: Data
Auth->>DB: Create authentication session
Auth-->>API: Access + refresh tokens
API-->>Web: Authentication response
Web-->>User: Authenticated
Note over Auth,DB: Sessions are individually revocable.
Note over API,Auth: Authentication and authorization are separate.
